    <string name="how">How to play</string>
    <string name="how_to_play">1. Tap or drag on the floor to walk.\n\n2. Stand near an oven to pick up fresh pizzas.\n\n3. Walk to the purple counter to drop them off.\n\n4. Customers queue up, buy pizzas and leave cash. Walk over the green cash spot to collect it.\n\n5. Spend your money in the SHOP: carry more, walk faster, bake faster, hire helpers and more.\n\nDon\'t keep customers waiting: they get angry and leave!</string>
